---
description: Stack and hard constraints for AI Store Manager
alwaysApply: true
---

# Stack

- Remix + `@shopify/shopify-app-remix` + Polaris + App Bridge
- Drizzle + Turso (libSQL); Postgres/MySQL later via Drizzle only
- Vercel + Vercel Cron (no long workers)
- Gemini (`gemini-2.0-flash`) for text; `sharp` for images
- Email: Resend
- Admin Core = separate cookie session (not Shopify session)

# Paths

- Merchant: `app/routes/app.*`
- Admin: `app/routes/admin.*` + `AdminLayout` only
- Services: `app/services/**/*.server.ts`
- Schema: `app/db/schema.ts`
